{"title": "Bag of Moulding", "pageid": 19370, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bag_of_Moulding", "categories": ["Containers", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp/300px-Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp, /w/images/5/5e/Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bag of Moulding image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5e/Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp/300px-Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5e/Leather_Pouch_Old_Faded.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Bag of Moulding</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous#Containers\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Container</a> that will rot any food that is put inside of it.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>All food that is put into this bag immediately grows mould and spoils.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/38px-Containers_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Containers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png/25px-Containers_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c2/Containers_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Containers\" title=\"Containers\">Containers</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Common\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: Common</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.2 kg (0.4 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 1 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  1  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-5a3fd1c441c03e40END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-a665bc0d84b38e64END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_WYR_Circus_BagOfMolding</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_WYR_Circus_BagOfMolding\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_WYR_Circus_BagOfMolding\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">e3781c5c-b674-4c9b-aec8-885e8c54698b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e3781c5c-b674-4c9b-aec8-885e8c54698b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:e3781c5c-b674-4c9b-aec8-885e8c54698b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Given as a consolation prize by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Akabi\" title=\"Akabi\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/25px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/38px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/50px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Akabi\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png/25px-Portrait_Akabi.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b4/Portrait_Akabi.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Akabi\" title=\"Akabi\">Akabi</a> after failing to win the jackpot at the <a href=\"/wiki/Circus_of_the_Last_Days#Layout\" title=\"Circus of the Last Days\">Wheel of Fortune</a></li></ul>\n</div>   <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>This bag rots all <a href=\"/wiki/Food\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Food\">Food</a> tagged items that are put inside it. However it does not affect drinks or supply packs. The conversions are listed as follows:\n</p>\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e9/FOOD_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fish\" title=\"Fish\">Fish</a></span> → <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotten_Fish\" title=\"Rotten Fish\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Rotten_Fish_A_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Rotten_Fish\" title=\"Rotten Fish\">Rotten Fish</a></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Banana\" title=\"Banana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/27/FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/27/FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/27/FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/27/FOOD_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Banana\" title=\"Banana\">Banana</a></span> → <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rotten_Banana\" title=\"Rotten Banana\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Rotten_Banana_Unfaded_Icon